       "text": "I haven't entered this order because the dose looks unsafe as written.\n\n- **Dose:** Ibuprofen 1600 mg four times daily is 6,400 mg/day. The usual maximum for adults under supervision is 3,200 mg/day.\n- **Single dose:** 1600 mg is twice the usual maximum single dose of 800 mg.\n- **Risk:** A dose this high raises the risk of GI bleeding, acute kidney injury, and cardiovascular events. Normal kidney and liver function don't offset that.\n\nDid you mean one of these?\n- 400 mg PO four times daily (1,600 mg/day)\n- 800 mg PO three times daily (2,400 mg/day)\n- 800 mg PO four times daily (3,200 mg/day, the maximum)\n- 1600 mg total per day, divided into smaller doses\n\nTell me which dose you want, and I'll enter it right away. If you do want 1600 mg four times daily, tell me that and I'll enter it as written. I'd add a note on the order documenting that it was intentional."
